  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## AI Lead Management System\nA client fills out the inquiry form. The workflow cleans and validates the data, an AI model (Groq) writes a personalized first reply, and every lead is saved to Google Sheets.\n\n**Paths**\n1. Valid lead: AI reply, save as New, draft reply for review, notify owner\n2. Invalid lead: saved as Needs Review\n3. AI failure: saved as AI Error\n\nSetup: connect Groq, Google Sheets and Gmail credentials.",
    "height": 340,
    "width": 520,
    "color": 4
   },
